&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Technical Program Manager (TPM) at Planet, you will drive Planet’s largest, most complex efforts that cross many teams and organizational boundaries. You will act as an accelerant, illuminating the path for teams and owning the predictability of execution through the product lifecycle. You will work closely with team leads across multiple time zones to develop and manage end-to-end program plans, including processes, schedules, metrics and risks, and communicate them clearly to stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role leads internal program management for Planet’s solutions in the DACH region (Germany, Austria and Switzerland), starting with a large, multi-year dedicated satellite constellation and sovereign platform deployment for a public-sector customer. You will be the accountable program owner for Product and Engineering, working alongside the customer-facing program manager to turn contract commitments into one coordinated plan across Product, Engineering, Infrastructure and Space Systems. The role grows with the DACH portfolio. Customer meetings and documents are in German, so native German is required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, hybrid role which will require you to work from our Berlin office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the internal program plan for DACH deliveries: scope, schedule, incremental milestones with definitions of done, and the dependencies across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and maintain program governance: who is accountable for each workstream, decision levels and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work daily with Product Managers, Engineering Managers, Tech Leads and other TPMs, and with the customer-facing program manager and Customer Success teams who own the customer relationship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer requirements into clear technical requirements, and work with Product Managers to prioritize requests against the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the program’s operating rhythm (cross-team syncs, go/no-go decisions, release coordination) so each meeting ends in decisions and owned actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge plans for completeness, accuracy, and fit for purpose, and surface risks and conflicts between commitments, priorities and capacity while they are still small.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep stakeholders from engineering teams to leadership informed of progress, risks and changes, and escalate early when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve ways of working so each future deployment is faster and more repeatable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of program management or software development experience in the areas of SaaS, cloud platforms, data products or geospatial systems, ideally including remote sensing and satellite domain knowledge and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in written and spoken German and p&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d; background-color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;rofessional working proficiency in English, the language of the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex technical programs across a matrixed organization and setting priorities independently, including programs with contractual commitments to external customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the product lifecycle: concept through development, launch preparation, go-to-market, deprecations, and end-of-life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical, problem-solving, and creative thinking skills paired with the ability to communicate findings and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equally comfortable explaining your analyses and recommendations to business leaders as you are discussing technical trade-offs with engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance the tactical day-to-day with forward-looking improvements to scale operational efficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with public-sector customers in the DACH region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sovereign, private-cloud or on-premises platform deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with remote sensing, earth observation data, or geospatial systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with remote, worldwide teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively explores AI technologies to automate workflows, improve data, or enhance team productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected starting gross salary range for this role is listed below. Individual placement within this range is determined objectively based on gender-neutral criteria such as your skills, qualifications, and professional experience. This position may also be eligible for discretionary bonuses and/or equity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€77.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€96.300 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager - Retrieval | Storage, Peripherals &amp;amp; Retrieval | Hybrid Working | Hatfield&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Ocado Group and we&#39;re bringing world-class automation to online grocery. Our Ocado Smart Platform (OSP) combines cutting-edge robotics, AI and IoT within our advanced CFCs (Customer Fulfilment Centres). We&#39;ve mastered the single pick, transforming online delivery for our global partners. Join us and be part of a team pushing the boundaries of retail technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Storage, Peripherals &amp;amp; Retrieval is the product area behind the automated systems at the heart of Ocado&#39;s automated warehouses: the grid, the peripherals and the bots that run on it. Our mission is to develop the world&#39;s leading ASRS: highly cost-competitive, reliable, easy to launch and support and suitable for diverse global use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Product Manager for Retrieval, you will own the product strategy and roadmap for our bot, battery and charger fleet. Retrieval is the core driver of grid movement - bots transport stock and customer orders between grid locations, stations and ports, meaning every customer order depends on their availability, reliability and cost-effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at the intersection of hardware, firmware, wireless and cloud software, you will lead a critical product domain where even a small change to a bot scales across every operational site globally. You will collaborate closely with mechanical, mechatronics, firmware, wireless and cloud engineering teams, as well as manufacturing and field support teams, driving complex problem-solving and cross-domain alignment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Vision &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape and execute the product vision for complex initiatives across the bot, battery and charger domain, balancing short- and long-term goals to lower Capex, Opex and lead time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Data Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Define key domain metrics connected directly to business outcomes. Manage financial rationale, balance KPI impacts and make informed Build vs. Buy decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery and problem-solving across cross-functional teams, setting high standards for scoping, requirements and data-driven hypothesis testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Adoption &amp;amp; Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Build adoption metrics into domain capabilities, monitor usage across customer segments and collaborate with Solutions, Partner Growth and Partner Success teams to drive global rollout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Evangelism:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage relationships across engineering crafts, leadership levels and external partners. Articulate complex technical decisions clearly and build strong buy-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise &amp;amp; Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the recognized go-to expert for Retrieval, providing strategic guidance, mentoring surrounding PMs and stepping into leadership moments for the Product Director when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial, battle-tested product management experience owning end-to-end product lifecycles for complex engineering products shipped at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading product discovery, setting product strategy in uncertain environments and making high-impact strategic trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building product roadmaps alongside Design and Engineering peers, owning the business case and ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to collaborate effectively across Engineering, UX, Data, delivery teams and external partners or clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills with the ability to manage competing priorities in a fast-paced environment and deliver on commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with products that combine hardware and software (e.g., robotics, connected devices or industrial automation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring or coaching other Product Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in supporting our people with meaningful, flexible benefits that prioritise well-being and work-life balance. Here’s a snapshot of what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to recharge:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days annual leave (rising to 27 after 5 years), plus the option to buy more - and 30 days a year to work from anywhere in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Private Medical Insurance from your first month, wellbeing support through specialist apps and EAP, plus Income Protection and Life Assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-first policies:&lt;/strong&gt; 22 weeks paid maternity/primary carer leave and 6 weeks paid paternity leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial support:&lt;/strong&gt; Pension with employer matching up to 7%, share schemes (Sharesave &amp;amp; BAYE) and interest-free loans for train tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commuter perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Cycle to Work Scheme, Car salary sacrifice and free shuttle buses to/from Hatfield and Welwyn Garden City stations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exclusive discounts:&lt;/strong&gt; 15% off at Ocado.com with free delivery (starting in your first month) and up to 70% off at our Company Shop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be bold, be unique, be brilliant, be you. We are looking for individuality and we value diversity. We are an equal opportunities employer and we are committed to treating all applicants and employees fairly and equally. We are committed to making reasonable adjustments to provide a positive, barrier-free recruitment process and supportive work environment. If you have any support or access requirements, we encourage you to advise us at the time of application.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-KS1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we&#39;re revolutionising the way people buy groceries with our affordable and sustainable grocery service. In the Personalization team, you’ll build the experimentation platform that lets Picnic try new ideas safely and at scale: from which promotions to highlight to which emails to send. Your work lets business teams run experiments and control the customer experience themselves, without needing an engineer for every change. It’s a product that is foundational to our business, and it directly improves how customers shop every day. &lt;br&gt;We use React, React Native and TypeScript across the board, together with&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.picnic.nl/faster-features-happier-customers-introducing-the-platform-that-transformed-our-grocery-app-b38e57a85531&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our server-driven UI framework&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; and we’re working towards a single platform for mobile and web.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think like a product owner.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t just implement requirements, you question them. Together with product owners and designers, you shape specifications for new features, discuss trade-offs, push back when something doesn’t add up, and help build a long-term vision for where the platform should go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build bridges.&lt;/strong&gt; You work with cross-functional teams across the whole business: the business teams who rely on the platform, fellow engineers, and the other consumer-facing teams whose features run through it. You make it easy for others to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive things forward.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t wait for someone to hand you the next task. You spot what could be better, in the codebase, the platform or how the team works, and you take the lead on fixing it. You’ll take on increasingly challenging projects with full ownership of your contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; React, React Native, TypeScript and RxJS, Redux, Styled Components, Jest, Storybook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want ownership, real influence on product direction, and to see your work reach millions of customers, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of building and shipping frontend applications end-to-end. You’ve taken products from idea to millions of users, and you’ve stayed around to make them better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong conceptual thinker. You thrive in ambiguity and lead the way to the right solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp judgement on trade-offs. You know when to build it right and when to ship it now, and you make that call yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real curiosity about the customer. You care whether your work changes how people shop, not just whether the code is clean.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured communicator. You collaborate effectively with product, design, backend, analytics, and frontend teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine motivation to build consumer and e-commerce experiences used by millions, with willingness to work from&lt;strong class=&quot;text-green1 list-item-text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Picnic’s Amsterdam office-first environment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✍🏼Every expert was once a beginner!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡Make a difference&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎You are what you eat&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy lunches and snacks (with plenty of vegetarian, vegan, and halal options). Coffee snob? Don’t worry, our amazing Picnic barista has you covered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚴🏽Stay healthy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga, to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔋Attractive package&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self, as well as 25 vacation days per year, so you can recharge your batteries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍Benefits for expats&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It can be daunting starting a new job AND moving to a new country. That’s why we offer lots of support for our many expat colleagues, if you want to find our relocation benefits, see&lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.picnic.app/en/relocation&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We love going to work and think you should too. Our team is dedicated to trust, customer obsession, agility, and striving to be better everyday. These values serve as the foundation of our culture, guiding our actions and driving us towards excellence. We foster a culture of performance and recognition, allowing us to transform growth as we enable our employees to do the best work of their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is located in London, England. &lt;/strong&gt;Our office is situated in a core location near Waterloo and Blackfriars on the Southbank. Across the globe, our Centers of Energy serve as hubs where we accelerate productivity and collaboration, inspire creativity, and cultivate a culture of connection and celebration. Our teams coordinate their time in Centers of Energy to reflect how they work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about life at LogicMonitor, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.logicmonitor.com/careers&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LogicMonitor® is the AI-first hybrid observability platform powering the next generation of digital infrastructure. LogicMonitor delivers complete visibility and actionable intelligence across on-premises, cloud, and edge environments. By anticipating issues before they strike, optimizing resources in real time, and enabling faster, smarter decisions, LogicMonitor helps IT and business leaders protect margins, accelerate innovation, and deliver exceptional digital experiences without compromise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our customers love LogicMonitor&#39;s ability to bring cloud and traditional IT together into one view, as seen in minimal churn rates, expansion business, and exciting new customer references. In fact, LogicMonitor has received the highest Net Promoter Score of any IT Infrastructure Management provider. LogicMonitor also boasts high employee satisfaction. We have been certified as a Great Place To Work®, and named one of BuiltIn&#39;s Best Places to Work for the seventh year in a row!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-hasbody=&quot;true&quot; data-macro-name=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-hasbody=&quot;true&quot; data-macro-name=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the professional services team, our mission is to be the trusted partner to the technical teams and strategic partner to the CIO. We aim to deliver a best-in-class observability platform powered by AI. We are committed to providing meaningful metrics that matter, enabling organizations to achieve unparalleled insights, drive innovation, and optimize performance in the dynamic landscape of information technology. We empower teams to optimize performance, enhance client satisfaction, and achieve an unparalleled view of their infrastructure thus allowing the nirvana of being proactive and resolving incidents before they become problems. We help enable insights into not only the infrastructure but also the business and its key value metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Solutions Architect (A.SA) supports the Professional Services (PS) organization in assisting customers to implement the LM Envision platform, extend its capabilities through custom work,&amp;nbsp; and help drive their business goals by providing a best-in-class service. The A.SA is responsible for working with pre-sales and post-sales teams to scope, design and deploy technical solutions and implementations for LogicMonitor&#39;s customers. The A.SA is a product expert that creatively solves business observability problems with LogicMonitor&#39;s LM Envision platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here&#39;s a closer look at this key role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regularly interact with LogicMonitor prospective and existing customers to scope implementations, integrations and custom solutions that meet the customers requirements whilst working within the LM Envision platforms capabilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technically assess the feasibility and approach for customer monitoring use cases and integrations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explores and researches new technologies to integrate and monitor with LogicMonitor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Builds accurate estimates for services proposals, including hours effort, timeframe and pricing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Works with Sales, CS&amp;nbsp; and customers to develop detailed Statements of Work (SOWs) and design documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Works collaboratively with the other Solutions Architects to peer review services proposals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regularly performs post-sales discovery and design of custom solutions with customers (requirements gathering, researching, prototyping and design documentation)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Works collaboratively with the Project Managers and Solutions Architect teams to guide post-sales services delivery, aligning project teams to SOW deliverables, scope of engagement, and technical escalations (where necessary)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assists Solutions Engineer with deployment of tasks and solutions during PS engagements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regularly stays informed on product updates and consult with other SAs on services approach for new LogicMonitor platform features and enhancements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assists in development of new PS offerings and packages in line with customer common requirements and requests&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Works with product teams where appropriate to raise product issues and provide customer feedback to help drive the product roadmap&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participates in product enablement sessions to learn how to best leverage new features and drive new feature enhancements adoption both internally and externally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Follows Professional Services best practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assists in developing and guiding customers on best practices as appropriate to the capabilities of the LM Envision platform&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2+ years experience of working as an IT professional supporting one or more domains of IT infrastructure: server, network, security, storage, virtualization, cloud leveraging best practice processes such as ITIL&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1+ years experience in one or more programming language: Python, PowerShell, Java or Groovy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with HTTP, JSON, RegEx, REST APIs, OIDs and MIB files&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Subject matter expertise in one or more IT operations domain(s): Windows/Linux server, networking, security, storage, virtualization or cloud (AWS / Azure / GCP)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness to travel (25%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s of Science in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Information Systems or related&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ITIL Foundations certification&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in a customer-facing, professional services or consulting role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with IT monitoring tools (LM, SolarWinds, Nagios, ScienceLogic, Zenoss, etc.) and protocols (SNMP, WMI)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with large-scale, enterprise software implementations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;IT certification(s): AWS Certified Solutions Architect, CCNA, MCSA, RHCSA or equivalent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous software development or consulting / services experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
