&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1677&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98918a7daaee&quot;&gt;Engage with customers to understand how they are adopting AI and validate solutions that help them operate these systems securely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1811&quot; data-local-id=&quot;90a71da9fb0f&quot;&gt;Collaborate with go-to-market teams to enable adoption and communicate the value of AI security capabilities to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
